# gujiconform -- Phase 2 (Platform IO pass): exit($code: Int): Never terminates
# the program with the given code, flushing stdout first (Section 15.4, like
# panic). The pre-exit line is flushed and appears on stdout; the post-exit line
# is unreachable. The code (7) becomes the process exit status. Both engines
# must agree on stdout AND exit code. Derived from the spec, not captured.
sub main() {
    print("before")
    exit(7)
    print("unreachable")
}
